status.json before regeneration, rather than editing generated counts or checkboxes. Example commands:") (:code-block "sh" "python3 tools/coverage_inventory.py /path/to/wxWidgets-3.2.12/interface
python3 tests/coverage-inventory.py /path/to/wxWidgets-3.2.12/interface
python3 tools/docset.py build
